{"id":"n22746-1-8","stage":3,"title":"공동체 · 团队","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n22746-1-8-1","ko":"우리는 죽어도 같이 죽고 살아도 같이 살아야 합니다!","zh":"我们就算死也要一起死，活着也要一起活！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리는","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리는","audio":"/audio/6cae49a92f8e0e0e2ffd.mp3"}},{"text":"죽어도","meaning":"即使死","explanation":"죽다：即使死；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"죽다","audio":"/audio/66bd3b1f27c0ee2e97b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20851","senseId":"1","lemma":"죽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죽어도","audio":"/audio/e83f491564f9f7022656.mp3"}},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同。","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}},{"text":"죽고","meaning":"死","explanation":"죽다：死；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"죽다","audio":"/audio/66bd3b1f27c0ee2e97b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20851","senseId":"1","lemma":"죽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죽고","audio":"/audio/28d8acfd05c6ba7bab23.mp3"}},{"text":"살아도","meaning":"活着、活下来","explanation":"살다：活着、生存；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"1","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살아도","audio":"/audio/12b238246353c507013f.mp3"}},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同。","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"2